{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"域扩张"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"域扩张"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>域扩张是域之间的同态; 由定义, 域的同态总是单射.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"代数扩张","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"正规扩张","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Galois扩张","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}